    <x:String x:Key="Organization_Usage_Title">Usage Instructions</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Organization_Usage_1">• After joining the organization, the software will automatically get security center configuration and network interception configuration from the server every time it starts</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Organization_Usage_2">• Configuration will be automatically applied locally, no manual operation required</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Organization_Usage_3">• You can click the "Sync Configuration" button to manually update the configuration</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Organization_Usage_4">• After leaving the organization, all configurations will be restored to local settings</x:String>
    
